{
  "summary": "To access Mozilla Thunderbird conveniently in Ubuntu, users can drag its application icon from Dash Home onto the desktop launcher. Within the application's inbox, bold text distinguishes unread emails, and new messages can be downloaded using the Get Mail option. Messages can be sorted in ascending or descending alphabetical order by clicking column headers like From or Subject. Thunderbird also enables organizing messages using tags such as Important or Work, with important emails highlighted in red. Tags can be removed by reselecting them, and the Quick Filter toolbar provides an option to display only tagged emails. Furthermore, Thunderbird supports message threads, grouping related correspondence into structured conversations. Users can enable threaded view from the corner of the inbox, inspect full conversation histories in the preview panel by clicking the threading symbol, and exit the view by clicking the thread icon again. Finally, emails can be saved into dedicated desktop folders for archiving and printing.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "fact": "A shortcut for Mozilla Thunderbird can be added by dragging its icon onto the launcher.",
      "evidence": "अब आइकन को launcher  पर ड्रैग और ड्रॉप करें"
    },
    {
      "fact": "Unread emails in the inbox are indicated by bold text.",
      "evidence": "ध्यान दें कि कुछ मैसेजेस बोल्ड हैं ये अपठित मैसेजेस हैं"
    },
    {
      "fact": "New emails are retrieved by clicking the Get Mail icon and choosing get all new messages.",
      "evidence": "get mail आइकन पर क्लिक करें और get all new messages चुनें"
    },
    {
      "fact": "Clicking the From column heading arranges the messages in alphabetical order.",
      "evidence": "कॉलम हैडिंग from पर क्लिक करें मैसेजेस अब एक वर्णानुक्रमी क्रम में श्रेणीबद्ध हो गये हैं"
    },
    {
      "fact": "Clicking the Subject heading sorts the inbox messages by subject.",
      "evidence": "subject पर क्लिक करें अब मैसेजेस subject द्वारा श्रेणीबद्ध हो गये हैं"
    },
    {
      "fact": "Tagging an email as important displays that message in red.",
      "evidence": "टूलबार से tag आइकन पर क्लिक करें और important चुनें ध्यान दें कि वह मेल लालरंग में प्रदर्शित होता है"
    },
    {
      "fact": "Clicking the tagged icon in the Quick Filter toolbar filters the view to show only tagged messages.",
      "evidence": "टैग किये गये मैसेजेस को देखने के लिए quick filter टूलबार में tagged  आइकन पर क्लिक करें"
    },
    {
      "fact": "Related messages shown in sequence or as a conversation are defined as message threads.",
      "evidence": "संबंधित मैसेज जो क्रम या वार्तालाप के रूप में प्रदर्शित होते हैं मैसेज threads  कहलाते हैं"
    },
    {
      "fact": "Clicking the threading symbol next to a thread reveals the complete conversation.",
      "evidence": "पूर्ण वार्तालाप देखने के लिए corresponding thread के आगे threading symbol पर क्लिक करें"
    },
    {
      "fact": "Clicking the thread icon again exits the thread view.",
      "evidence": "thread व्यू से बाहर आने के लिए केवल thread आइकन पर फिर से क्लिक करें"
    }
  ]
}
